Package: DECIDE
Title: Evidence-Based Humanitarian Targeting: Design, Selection and Monitoring
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Brice Baem", "BAGOA", , "brice.bagoa@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Brice Baem BAGOA [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Brice Baem BAGOA <brice.bagoa@outlook.com>
Description: DECIDE helps humanitarian teams reach the right people.
    It supports the whole targeting cycle: designing an evidence-based
    scorecard from needs-assessment data, selecting and prioritising
    beneficiaries from registration data with data-quality checks, and
    monitoring implementation with post-distribution and process
    monitoring. Every step is recorded in an audit trail and documented in
    self-contained reports that serve as evidence for review and audit.
